pyrophosphate, and two Mg<sup>2+ </sup>ions bound: Insights into catalytic mechanism</article-title><source>Biochemistry</source><year>1999</year><volume>38</volume><fpage>14495</fpage><lpage>14506</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10545171</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1021/bi990508i</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B15"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>H&#x000e9;roux</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>White</surname><given-names>EL</given-names></name><name><surname>Ross</surname><given-names>LJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Davis</surname><given-names>RL</given-names></name><name><surname>Borhani</surname><given-names>DW</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Crystal structures of the <italic>Toxoplasma gondii </italic>hypoxantine-guanine phosphoribosyltransferase &#x02013; GMP and IMP complexes: Comparison of purine binding interactions with the XMP complex</article-title><source>Biochemistry</source><year>1999</year><volume>38</volume><fpage>14485</fpage><lpage>14494</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10545170</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1021/bi990507q</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B16"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Somoza</surname><given-names>JR</given-names></name><name><surname>Chin</surname><given-names>MS</given-names></name><name><surname>Focia</surname><given-names>PJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Wang</surname><given-names>CC</given-names></name><name><surname>Fletterick</surname><given-names>RJ</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Crystal structure of the hypoxanthine-guanine-xantine phosphoribosyltransferase from the protozoan parasite <italic>Tritrichomonas foetus </italic></article-title><source>Biochemistry</source><year>1996</year><volume>35</volume><fpage>7032</fpage><lpage>7040</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8679528</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">